            "Borrows are temporary permissions: any number of shared borrows or one mutable borrow, and a "
            "reference cannot outlive its referent. Dropping the owner runs `Drop` deterministically.",
            "Enums model alternatives, traits provide polymorphism (static through generics, dynamic through "
            "`dyn`), and `Option`/`Result` model absence and failure. `Send` and `Sync` gate cross-thread "
            "sharing, so data races are rejected in safe code; `unsafe` is an explicit, auditable opt-out.",
